// Modifications:
//   · `Box::new(3)` -> `Box::new(3i64)`; upstream's `Box<_>` inference is spelled out
//   · `thread::spawn` -> a local `fn spawn<F>(f: F)`; there is no thread plane here and
//     the subject is the MOVE INTO THE CLOSURE, not what the callee does with it
//   · `println!("v={}", *v)` -> `let _ = *v;` — the same deref READ of the capture
//   · `w.use_ref()` -> `use_ref(w)` (the upstream blanket-impl `Fake` trait exists only
